      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can use GrSkSLFP::Specialize, because that\u0027s operating at the FP level. This code is using public Skia API (SkShader, etc), and can actually run on CPU, too.\n\nI do think the non-thread-safe cache rework is fine, though.",
